    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Communal garden and bike storage\t\r\nLocal eateries nearby\t\r\nDublin bus links outside\t\r\nBeside Sundrive Shopping Centre"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/213a-kimmage-road-lower-flat-5-kimmage-dublin-d6wtc53\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Apartment 5, Larrissa Court, 213A Kimmage Road Lower, Kimmage in Dublin.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Kimmage, Apartment 5, Larrissa Court, offers a charming one-bedroom residence within a private and established development. Extending to approximately 41 sq. m., the apartment provides a practical layout with well-proportioned accommodation, making it an appealing option for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a low-maintenance home in a convenient Dublin location.\r\n\r\nThe development presents a traditional exterior with rendered finishes and brick detailing, set alongside a communal garden area for residents to enjoy. Secure bike storage adds further convenience, particularly for those seeking an accessible city base.\r\n\r\nStepping inside, the entrance hall leads through to a comfortable living/dining room, a bright and welcoming space with a large window, warm timber-style flooring, and a feature fireplace that adds character to the room. The layout allows for both relaxation and dining, creating a practical everyday living area.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is separate from the main living space and is fitted with classic cabinetry, tiled flooring, and useful counter space. Its compact design is well arranged, providing the essentials for day-to-day cooking while remaining neatly tucked away from the living area.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom is notably generous for a one-bedroom apartment, offering excellent floor space, fitted wardrobes, and a large window that brings in natural light. The bathroom, accessible from the hallway, is finished in neutral tiling and includes a shower, wash hand basin, and WC, providing a clean and functional layout.\r\n\r\nLocated on Kimmage Road Lower, the property enjoys excellent convenience, with bus connections just outside the development offering access across Dublin. Sundrive Shopping Centre is close by and provides a range of everyday essentials, including groceries, hardware, and medical supplies. The surrounding area also offers a strong selection of local cafes and eateries, including Pickles, adding to the appeal of the location.\r\n\r\nThis apartment is an attractive choice for buyers seeking a well-located one-bedroom home with a practical layout and strong local amenities. Its comfortable living space, generous bedroom, communal garden access, and excellent transport links make it a smart option in a sought-after city setting."
      },
      {
